WEBVTT

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.010
More nice weather today.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:21.910
Wh-What in the world is that?

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.040
A giant boat... Maybe a boat tsukumogami?

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:31.800
People... No, they're tsukumogami. Hang on...

00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:35.430
Are those the Mayoiga villagers?!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.320
A fusion of Mayoiga with the 
fishing boat, <i>Kicchomaru</i>.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:43.420
This should ensure that no one will run out 
of spiritual strength during our journey.

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:48.220
We're so high up! Wow!

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.840
Miurahi-sama can do this kind of thing?

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:52.420
It's incredible...

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:54.950
No, it's all thanks to the shard.

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:57.770
The fusion and flight are taken care of.

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:59.440
Next, we need to be hidden.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:03.580
That'll make sure malison exorcists 
and gods don't interfere.

00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.200
It vanished?

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:18.470
Say what?!

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:20.980
I getcha.

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.600
What is it? Did something happen?

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:27.650
Seems a giant boat just took to the 
skies from the mountains up in Tohoku.

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:31.230
A boat... in the mountains?

00:01:31.230 --> 00:01:32.590
Does that mean...

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:36.240
Yeah. I figure it's gotta 
be the Mayoiga folks.

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:39.100
And they're prob'ly headed for Kamioka.

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:41.900
This ain't gonna be like last time.

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:46.000
They're comin' at us with everything 
they've got to settle this.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:47.480
Oh, no.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:49.500
What do we do, Kiriha-san?

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.920
<b>Hakusan Shrine</b>

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:51.820
What else?

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.280
We face them!

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:20.070
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:20.070
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.480
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.480
m 0 0 l 0 -10 l 10 -10 l 10 0

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:31.480
<b>Chapter 11</b>

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:31.470
<b>Total War</b>

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.780
"Total War."

00:03:35.970 --> 00:03:37.460
It's finally time.

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:42.240
Taguri-san, who's this?

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.570
Oh, this is Old Bell from the Tenshou Shrine.

00:03:43.240 --> 00:03:50.750
Enshrined Deity of Tenshou Shrine
\hYagokoro Omoinokane no Mikoto\h

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.430
The name's Yagokoro Omoinokane no Mikoto.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:52.250
Taguri-chan here asked me to help out.

00:03:53.450 --> 00:03:54.500
Wait...

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.310
Yagokoro-san... as in from 
the malison forecast?

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:59.630
Yep! He's a weather god.

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:02.430
We're up against quite the little army.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.510
You sure you've still got 
enough fight for this?

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:10.270
Well, I'd better charge up 
my vitality while I can!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.620
<b>Rub       Rub      Rub    Rub    Rub    Rub    Rub</b>

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.740
Give that another shot after 
you've become a little girl.

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:16.720
Brutal...

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:18.100
Heck no!

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:20.340
Yer hurt, so buzz off!

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.210
I will not.

00:04:21.210 --> 00:04:23.030
This is no time for me to be bedridden.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.790
Kokuyou-san...

00:04:24.790 --> 00:04:27.660
You can hardly blame her, 
given the danger Kukuri is in.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.910
Yeah, but...

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.570
By the way, you were unable 
to reach Akito and Mimane, right?

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:35.420
Yeah. I was hoping they'd help...

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:40.060
Yer all doing this for my sake... 
I sure am grateful.

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:45.460
<i>But still, we're takin' on a bunch 
of powerful tsukumogami.</i>

00:04:46.550 --> 00:04:49.260
<i>If push comes to shove, I'll use my last resort.</i>

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.810
We're not to hurt the malison exorcist?

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.610
That's going to be difficult.

00:04:58.610 --> 00:05:00.570
We're trying to kill the god of this land.

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:03.840
The exorcist will naturally 
try to prevent that.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:06.070
I doubt we can avoid fighting him.

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:09.070
It was a deal. Keep your end.

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.120
You're asking too much, Azami.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.830
We'll do what we can, but...

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:20.840
Please, wait!

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:24.470
Arumi and I will deal with 
Kagami Kazuya and Kiriha!

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:29.090
We're acquainted with them. 
We'll be able to keep them occupied!

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:31.660
Fine.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.620
But I won't be joining you.

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:37.740
Why?

00:05:38.740 --> 00:05:42.410
Because I can't enter Kamioka.

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.920
Not while this barrier stands.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:54.930
We're about to enter the air over Kamioka.

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:55.870
Right.

00:05:58.030 --> 00:06:01.730
As you all know, my shard's power 
is on the verge of running out.

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:06.250
We must kill the goddess and take her shard.

00:06:06.250 --> 00:06:08.380
Retreating is not even an option anymore.

00:06:10.310 --> 00:06:14.140
This will be the battle that 
decides the fate of Mayoiga.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:15.920
Remember that.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.400
What is this?!

00:06:20.110 --> 00:06:22.920
A mesh of fire?!

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.530
Our invisibility has been dispelled!

00:06:25.210 --> 00:06:26.650
There you are!

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:28.840
Who goes there?!

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.090
The goddess of Komiya, 
the area you're flying over...

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.030
The mighty Hi-no-Kagutsuchi!

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:35.840
A different regional goddess?!

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:37.540
How did you see through our invisibility?

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:43.920
Nothing's easier than ambushing people 
making a beeline for their target.

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.420
Even if you knew where we were headed, 
that's too little to have guessed...

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:52.580
Just how wide of a net did 
you set for us, you monster?!

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.550
Your stupid scheme's already 
spoiled, so run on home.

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:57.310
Go now and I won't even hurt you.

00:06:57.670 --> 00:07:00.280
Might as well enjoy the time you've got left.

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:03.090
We may be at a disadvantage 
against a goddess,

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:07.320
but we accounted for disruptions 
in malison before setting out.

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:09.380
Mimane, take care of it.

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:10.700
Aye-aye, sir!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:13.940
So you wanna do this?

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:16.700
Probably underestimating me 
since I'm just a projection.

00:07:17.010 --> 00:07:18.830
Bad idea!

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.460
Defensive positions!

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:22.970
Skyfire!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.890
So they withstood that, huh?

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.220
Should've expected as much from such 
a venerable bunch of tsukumogami.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:41.300
We will not reach our goal if 
we can't evade this goddess!

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:42.480
Let's do this, everyone!

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:44.860
You're on!

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:46.750
<b>Dragon</b>

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.070
Karmic Skyfire...

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:34.660
<b>Karmic Skyfire: Flame-Eating Raptor</b>

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:34.250
Flame-Eater Raptor!

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:38.160
Blasted to kindling! Serves you right.

00:08:40.930 --> 00:08:43.460
Ha ha, fooled you!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:46.300
That was just a phony 
I whipped up with a mirror!

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.420
No wonder it seemed so easy!

00:08:50.510 --> 00:08:56.430
<i>There's no way two or three tsukumogami 
could've pulled off a ruse like that.</i>

00:08:56.760 --> 00:09:00.360
<i>The rest are probably still out 
there, and invisible again.</i>

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:04.180
<i>But they can't have gotten far...</i>

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:05.690
<i>I get it!</i>

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:09.760
<i>They want to slow me down.
They're using the boat as a decoy,</i>

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:11.930
<i>with their main forces heading into Kamioka.</i>

00:09:12.340 --> 00:09:13.730
Then that's where I'm—

00:09:13.730 --> 00:09:15.200
Stop, fire goddess.

00:09:15.200 --> 00:09:17.900
What is it? I'm done with you fools.

00:09:17.900 --> 00:09:22.250
That clash of spiritual power just now is 
likely to disturb malison in this area.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:26.080
That's going to give rise to 
aberrations that will cause chaos.

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.730
The gods of this region, and its 
malison exorcist, will take action...

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:33.090
And we will then hunt them down.

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:37.300
Are you going to abandon your 
duty and let that happen?

00:09:37.300 --> 00:09:39.010
You pains in the ass...

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:50.230
I don't believe we've met before.

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:54.240
Arbitrator of the gods, guardian of rainfall...

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:58.280
Symbol of the holy mountains of Kaga, 
one of the great divine pillars...

00:09:58.280 --> 00:10:00.240
The patron deity of Hakusan Shrine...

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:03.040
Kukurihime no Kami no Mikoto.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:04.760
It's an honor to meet you.

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:06.980
The youkai incarnation 
of the Miura residence,

00:10:06.980 --> 00:10:08.890
home to wealthy merchants 
of Tsuchibuchi Village...

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:14.130
Founder and leader of the village for 
tsukumogami without masters, Mayoiga.

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:18.510
You must be Miurahi. 
I've been wanting to see you.

00:10:19.010 --> 00:10:22.890
Mayoiga is a paradise for tsukumogami 
abandoned by selfish masters

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:26.250
and forsaken by merciless gods.

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:31.900
And now, with the loss of our shard's 
spiritual strength, it is in danger.

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:36.520
Though the gods may save men, 
they did not save us tsukumogami.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:40.530
You will atone for this injustice 
by surrendering your shard.

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:44.090
It ain't that Iwanagahime 
no Mikoto chose not to

00:10:44.090 --> 00:10:46.290
save the tsukumogami a millennium ago.

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:48.600
She <i>couldn't</i> save 'em.

00:10:49.450 --> 00:10:51.040
Gods ain't all-powerful.

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:54.670
But we do all we can, 
trying to live up to our duties.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:57.190
God, human, or tsukumogami,

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:59.930
you do what you can with what 
you've got, and hope for the best.

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:03.260
You reach for more than that,

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:04.890
and it'll all slip through yer fingers.

00:11:05.670 --> 00:11:07.060
Those limits apply to everyone.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.460
Tsukumogami can't exist without humans.

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:14.680
And if you've forgotten that...

00:11:15.550 --> 00:11:17.320
I ain't giving you anything!

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:30.740
She's being pushed back!

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:31.830
Not good!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:32.710
Kukuri-chan!

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:35.340
Let me help!

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:37.340
Nah! Just watch my back!

00:11:37.570 --> 00:11:38.600
But...

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:41.470
<i>I'm outta options...</i>

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:45.380
Barrier, release!

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:51.600
Is that...

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:53.350
It can't be!

00:11:56.110 --> 00:12:01.860
<b>Patron Deity of Hakusan Shrine 
Kukurihime no Ookami</b>

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:01.250
The Patron Deity of Hakusan Shrine, 
Kukurihime no Ookami!

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:11.560
<i>Impossible! She was supposed 
to have been weakened!</i>

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:16.380
<i>Is this her true form? Her true strength?!</i>

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:25.200
<i>How much power was she 
expending on that barrier?!</i>

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:28.610
Come forth, great swell of the heavens...

00:12:29.700 --> 00:12:30.890
Water Impact.

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:38.020
Miurahi-sama!

00:12:58.060 --> 00:12:59.670
This battle is over.

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.930
Miurahi-sama!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:01.920
Stay back!

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:05.740
It's not... over yet....

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.290
Please, stop!

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:19.640
If we can find good partners for all of you,

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:23.440
there won't have to be any more fighting!

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:29.700
I'll help! It might not be soon, 
but with someone you can trust, one day...

00:13:31.270 --> 00:13:35.600
And when will that be? A thousand 
years from now? Two thousand?

00:13:36.390 --> 00:13:40.820
Do the men and gods who look down 
upon us now deign to pity us?

00:13:41.910 --> 00:13:45.060
I've committed the crime 
of murdering a god.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:50.470
There is no other path for me!

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:02.130
Wh... What...

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.360
You were waiting for this...

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.990
For the moment the barrier 
was released. Weren't you?

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.260
Azami.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:21.500
The shard? Oh, no!

00:14:41.620 --> 00:14:42.860
Is that...

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:47.680
Mom?

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:52.900
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:52.900
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:52.300
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:57.410
<b>Tsugu</b>

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:57.410
<b>Tsugumomo</b>

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.010
<i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>!

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:00.170
Kanaka-sama?!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:04.250
Miurahi-sama...

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:06.860
Why would they...

00:15:09.530 --> 00:15:12.720
How? How didn't we see this coming?!

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:16.380
I will fight the regional goddess alone.

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:18.810
The rest of you will stay back.

00:15:20.490 --> 00:15:23.960
I doubt they want to kill 
anyone unless they need to.

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:28.820
If I step forward by myself, 
I imagine she will do the same.

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:33.700
Could you check and see 
if this decision is wise?

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:34.720
Yes.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:40.960
It shouldn't be a problem.

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:44.740
Akito, Arumi, the technique 
you two perform together...

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:47.710
Guiding Foresight and Mental Link?

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:52.520
Right. Guiding Foresight lets me 
see a few moments into the future,

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:55.660
but I'm unable to move while using it.

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:56.850
Which is why...

00:15:57.850 --> 00:16:03.600
I use this hair ornament to communicate 
what I see to my brother with Mental Link.

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:08.180
I'd like the two of you to monitor 
things from a distance, then.

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:14.780
If you sense anything amiss, 
try to prevent it, or warn me.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:15.780
Understood.

00:16:17.810 --> 00:16:21.540
We were watching the future 
with Guiding Foresight!

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:25.130
Why weren't we able to 
predict Azami's attack?!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:29.760
After all this time, 
checking so many fortunes,

00:16:29.760 --> 00:16:34.200
we've always tried to make the 
best decision for Mayoiga!

00:16:34.710 --> 00:16:36.450
And this is the result?!

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:40.170
Tsk.

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:48.310
The bow and arrow tsukumogami gets 
duplicated by the mirror tsukumogami...

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:50.080
What a damned pain.

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:53.120
What's that?

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:57.410
Why did you become visible?!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:59.780
What's going on, Mifune?! 
She's going to target you!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:03.540
I don't know! But Miurahi-sama's 
power just vanished!

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:07.290
I can't... hold on...

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.220
They're reverting to their original forms!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.880
Has Mayoiga's protection vanished?!

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:23.850
Shien, can you use your smoke 
to gather up the others?

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.060
I can't! This is as much as I can manage!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:35.320
Guys!

00:17:39.830 --> 00:17:42.700
How's that?! I got all 
your survivors right here!

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.460
Wh-Why would you help us?!

00:17:45.780 --> 00:17:48.210
Why? Because the fight's over!

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:52.770
Your boat is falling apart and your 
buddies are running out of strength

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:54.960
because Miurahi is dead, right?

00:17:55.490 --> 00:17:59.570
If you guys come quietly, 
I'll use my power to keep you alive!

00:17:59.570 --> 00:18:00.470
What's your call?!

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:05.200
The longer you wait, 
the more casualties you risk!

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:09.240
I understand. We'll obey.

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:10.560
Please, help our villagers.

00:18:24.470 --> 00:18:26.770
Oh, yikes! I'm naked!

00:18:26.770 --> 00:18:27.660
Seriously?

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:31.000
There we go.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:38.760
Thank you two so much!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.850
Nice work!

00:18:45.030 --> 00:18:46.140
Now, then...

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:49.600
Hi, gang! It's been a while!

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:53.260
Impossible...

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:57.900
I know that I killed Kanaka!

00:18:58.150 --> 00:18:59.900
I pierced her heart!

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:03.660
So how... is she alive?!

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.910
What is this, Kukuri?!

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:09.210
We do not have the time 
for a full explanation.

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:12.420
Kazuya-san, listen closely.

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:19.420
Those two girls, Azami, 
are an amasogi that you created.

00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:22.480
Me?

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:27.360
She possessed Kanaka, 
who is now a part of them.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.800
I... I created her?

00:19:39.610 --> 00:19:41.450
And Mom was possessed?

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:45.090
And after that...

00:19:59.260 --> 00:20:00.140
Kazuya!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.090
Kanaka was strong. But...

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:10.350
A weakness in her mind left her vulnerable, 
and she was tsukumo-possessed.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:13.470
How...

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:14.150
Kazuya!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.730
How can we save my mom?!

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:19.480
Kanaka is already dead.

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:23.600
What you see is an empty husk 
being manipulated by an amasogi.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:26.370
But... But she's still my mom!

00:20:26.740 --> 00:20:28.920
And those girls... 
If we just talk this through...

00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:32.940
It won't work. Their goal 
is incompatible with yours.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:37.440
Goal? What's their goal?

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:41.890
Azami's... That amasogi's goal...

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.630
is to see you dead.

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:46.680
Why?

00:20:47.390 --> 00:20:52.140
Kazuya-san, this amasogi must be 
destroyed by the person who created it.

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:56.650
If anyone else does so, you will be 
struck by an atonement curse

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.650
equivalent to what she has wrought.

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:04.650
And this amasogi is beyond the pale! 
The atonement won't stop with your death.

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:08.500
The entire town will likely pay the toll.

00:21:08.990 --> 00:21:12.100
There is only one to resolve this.

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:15.130
You must slay Azami and Kanaka!

00:21:17.980 --> 00:21:20.130
And there you have it!

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.670
Ya-kun, you took your sweet time catching on.

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:27.300
But now it's finally time!

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:31.000
Y'know, I've been waiting for 
this moment for a long time.

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:33.430
The moment when...

00:21:35.050 --> 00:21:38.440
I get to experience the 
thrill of fighting you.

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.320
<i>I have to fight Mom?</i>

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:47.700
<i>I have to... kill...</i>

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:49.990
<i>my mom?</i>

00:23:19.960 --> 00:23:32.970
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:25.250
Azami's goal was using the power of a 
shard to revive my mother, Kagami Kanaka.

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:29.380
And there's only one way to put an 
end to this: I have to kill my mom.

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.970
Next time on <i>Tsugu Tsugumomo</i>, 
Chapter 12, the final episode: "Decision."

00:23:29.380 --> 00:23:32.970
<b>Decision</b>

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.200
Don't miss it!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Don't miss it!</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.250
